WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Sidechain ducking: the bass dips on every kick, so both are heard.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.600
In the Simple layout it's one pick: the bass track's Duck under, then Drums.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Now the bass breathes with the beat. The Duck knob sets how deep.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.000
The Pattern layout way, in the Mixer:

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.000
Select Drums, right-click the chords' arrow: Sidechain to this track.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:39.000
Then add a compressor to the chords: it listens to the drums.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:45.600
Every hit pushes the chords down for a moment: the classic pump.
